{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Qohelet sought to find words of delight.</b> It is the supernal wisdom, until he found. The subject-matter is what delight there is in this — that it was created thus, and why thus." "<b>And that which is upright.</b> It is the meaning, and like it is concerning the Book of Jashar, which is not in our hands."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:22.119982972Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}